Usage: superset agents list [options]

List agents configured on a host

Options:
  --namespace <string>  Local namespace
  --host <string>       Target host machineId (required unless --local)
  --local               Target this machine (required unless --host)

Global options:
  --json              Output as JSON (auto-on under CI/agent envs)
  --quiet             Output IDs only
  --api-key <string>  Use a Superset API key (sk_live_…) instead of OAuth login [$SUPERSET_API_KEY]

  --help, -h       Show help
